    description: Zenodo archive of the TEI XML and schema (this version)
abstract: >-
  A TEI/XML encoding of the 17th chapter of
  Kamalaśīla's Tattvasaṅgrahapañjikā (kārikās 1212–1360),
  with reproducible visualizations of the debate structure
  and the text-reuse and mention network. Includes semantic annotations for
  74 instances of text reuse (q elements) and 122 referring
  strings (rs elements) for persons, groups, and works
  (including pronominal substitutes), along with 17 registered
  scholars, 12 philosophical schools, and 16 registered source
  texts and manuscript witnesses (with an additional 2 secondary
  scholarship entries). 64 app elements record variant
  readings between the two editions. Includes four Jupyter notebooks reproducing
  the figures used in the accompanying dissertation.
keywords:
